{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/bc272690f91fa3e0716b688162119592.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a real-time flying Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fly through the checkpoints as fast as you can. Use full-use of your flight controls in 3D-Space to build a track through all the checkpoints as fast as possible. But be careful, crashes will slow you down and if you hit your own track \u2192 it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/4a7a1b805e8f733352dedc4aa8f15352.poster.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/4a7a1b805e8f733352dedc4aa8f15352.webm?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/4a7a1b805e8f733352dedc4aa8f15352.mp4?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/f2130f0fe9e70ce8bdba94595956b7a4.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the track you built yourself. For the race on track you can make use of your already existing driving skills as you will need to drive perfect turns to get the highest score possible. Your build and race time together will determine your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your own ghost and get faster and faster. Compare yourself with your friends on a global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/862a469964702713c586a8d66e3e4700.poster.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/862a469964702713c586a8d66e3e4700.webm?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/862a469964702713c586a8d66e3e4700.mp4?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/1e54fda37cde123827cdb2de381dafea.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d84ea2d8a150b275ec2e29e2d6a42d98.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 6 Campaigns with 36 Levels to unlock all 6 Racer Models and 64 Colors. You can then choose your unique combination of Builder Color, Racer Model and Racer Color to show it of to your friends when you reach #1 in the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/7a94c658a859fafb9f2399db7736f70d.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players in exciting short rounds in the local multiplayer. First, all players build a track at the same time. If you hit a track of someone else or your own, you will have to restart. Whoever gets to the finish first will gain the most points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/cac6b2e018b9f7e6cf90dd913b7ca6c2.poster.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/cac6b2e018b9f7e6cf90dd913b7ca6c2.webm?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/cac6b2e018b9f7e6cf90dd913b7ca6c2.mp4?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the building is complete, all players will race the tracks of each other. First to finish gets the most points. Will you come out on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/03dd202f45da199cb7676736f7174b6a.poster.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/03dd202f45da199cb7676736f7174b6a.webm?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/03dd202f45da199cb7676736f7174b6a.mp4?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/c09ca6928bc1071782245eb7de8935b3.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=115 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2731160?t=1769111881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a