omplete, all players will race the tracks of each other. First to finish gets the most points. Will you come out on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/03dd202f45da199cb7676736f7174b6a.poster.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/03dd202f45da199cb7676736f7174b6a.webm?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/03dd202f45da199cb7676736f7174b6a.mp4?t=1769111881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/c09ca6928bc1071782245eb7de8935b3.avif?t=1769111881\" width=780 height=115 /></span></p>","developers":["Stumi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/202bed8cfafd2ec58ba6ed5deb2a941da664469e/header.jpg?t=1769111881","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Sonoma</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic